          "url": deluxUrl,
          "name": "Deluxe Skylight Suite — Whispering Pines Resort near Mukteshwar",
          "description": "Deluxe skylight attic suite with cedar pine deck and star-gazing ceiling at Whispering Pines Resort, Malla Ramgarh"
