      "description": "Whispering Pines Resort by Casa De Bello is a 4-star boutique heritage mountain resort located on the Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar Road in Malla Ramgarh, Mukteshwar, Uttarakhand. The property features 25 premium rooms and a private 10-guest villa perched at 1,780 metres altitude with 180 degree panoramic views of the Nanda Devi and Trishul Himalayan peaks from all rooms. Surrounded by private apple, peach, plum and apricot orchards and dense pine canopies, the resort offers an expansive variety of multi-cuisine and regional Kumaoni dining, cozy fireplace rooms, 150 Mbps fiber Wi-Fi, and pet-friendly enclosed gardens. Built as the upgraded successor to Clarks Exotica Mukteshwar, Whispering Pines is the premier destination for mountain relaxation, family holidays, and peaceful rejuvenation.",
      "telephone": "+917505029696",
      "email": "booking@whisperingpinesresort.in",
      "priceRange": "₹₹₹",
      "currenciesAccepted": "INR",
